# Part 3: Inside sibl

This part is in progress. It will go inside the source tree and follow one input file through the linker pipeline.

## Planned topics

- The role of each module in `src/`.
- How zero-copy slices and arena allocation move through the pipeline.
- How the parser feeds symbols and sections into the layout and relocation stages.
- How the unit tests are organized and how to add a new test.
- How to update the roadmap and send a clean change.

## Until then

Read [Part 1](/docs/part-1-getting-started) for the build steps and the project map. The [roadmap](/roadmap) lists the phases that are still open.
